  "description": "A fateful encounter between a girl and a... cat?\n\nMoments after trying to save a cat from an oncoming truck, Ha-Ji Kang finds herself transported to Cat Kingdom. There, she encounters Gyeol-Han Ko, a cold and unforgiving prince, and is immediately thrown into a cell. What is this strange land, and will Haji be able to return home?\n\n(Source: Manta) \n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
